      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "표준적인 표기에서 단일항은 다음 상태로 이루어지고,"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b13:l0:s0-16",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        13,
        0,
        0,
        16
      ],
      "source": "whereas the three basis states of the triplet are",
      "rect": [
        72.91802978515625,
        530.9784545898438,
        314.2098083496094,
        542.9336547851562
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91802978515625,
        540.3070068359375
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "삼중항의 세 기저 상태는 다음과 같다:"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l0:s0-28",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        0,
        0,
        28
      ],
      "source": "Anikó és Botond wish to understand the entanglement of the states of the triplet representa-",
      "rect": [
        72.91897583007812,
        593.3434448242188,
        554.0440063476562,
        605.2986450195312
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91897583007812,
        602.6719970703125
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "아니코와 보톤드는 삼중항 표현에 속한 상태들의 얽힘을 이해하려"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l1:s0-4",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        1,
        0,
        4
      ],
      "source": "tion. The vector",
      "rect": [
        72.91897583007812,
        605.6294555664062,
        160.2158660888672,
        617.5846557617188
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91897583007812,
        614.9580078125
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "한다. 벡터"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l1:s9-35",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        1,
        9,
        35
      ],
      "source": "is interesting: it is orthogonal to the singlet, and it also has zero total",
      "rect": [
        183.5009765625,
        605.6294555664062,
        554.052490234375,
        617.5846557617188
      ],
      "point": [
        183.5009765625,
        614.9580078125
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "은 단일항에 직교하면서 전체 자화도 0이라는 점에서"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l2:s0-0",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        2,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "magnetization.",
      "rect": [
        72.91897583007812,
        617.5474243164062,
        148.38021850585938,
        629.5026245117188
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91897583007812,
        626.8759765625
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "흥미롭다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l3:s0-4",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        3,
        0,
        4
      ],
      "source": "Botond says that",
      "rect": [
        72.91897583007812,
        634.6534423828125,
        162.10476684570312,
        646.608642578125
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91897583007812,
        643.9819946289062
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "보톤드는"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l3:s9-21",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        3,
        9,
        21
      ],
      "source": "has zero entanglement. The reason being that",
      "rect": [
        185.09898376464844,
        634.6534423828125,
        426.6299133300781,
        646.608642578125
      ],
      "point": [
        185.09898376464844,
        643.9819946289062
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "의 얽힘은 0이라고 말한다. 그 이유는"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l3:s26-34",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        3,
        26,
        34
      ],
      "source": "is in the triplet rep-",
      "rect": [
        449.5820007324219,
        634.6534423828125,
        553.9149169921875,
        646.608642578125
      ],
      "point": [
        449.5820007324219,
        643.9819946289062
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "이 삼중항"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l4:s0-24",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        4,
        0,
        24
      ],
      "source": "resentation, which includes product states, and entanglement is a quantity which is invariant",
      "rect": [
        72.91900634765625,
        646.8724365234375,
        554.0560913085938,
        658.82763671875
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91900634765625,
        656.2009887695312
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "표현에 속하고, 이 표현에는 곱상태가 포함되며, 얽힘은"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l5:s0-6",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        5,
        0,
        6
      ],
      "source": "with respect to rotations.",
      "rect": [
        72.91900634765625,
        658.4264526367188,
        202.81227111816406,
        670.3816528320312
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91900634765625,
        667.7550048828125
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "회전에 대해 불변인 양이기 때문이라는 것이다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l6:s0-2",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        6,
        0,
        2
      ],
      "source": "Anikó says that it is best to actually perform the computation. She says that the sign difference",
      "rect": [
        72.91900634765625,
        674.7994384765625,
        554.0679321289062,
        686.754638671875
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91900634765625,
        684.1279907226562
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "아니코는 직접 계산하는 것이 가장 좋다고 한다. 부호의 차이는"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l7:s0-20",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        7,
        0,
        20
      ],
      "source": "will not matter at all, and the entanglement in the state",
      "rect": [
        72.91900634765625,
        687.08642578125,
        368.7026672363281,
        699.0416259765625
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91900634765625,
        696.4149780273438
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "전혀 중요하지 않으므로, 상태"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l7:s25-33",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        7,
        25,
        33
      ],
      "source": "(for example the von Neumann",
      "rect": [
        391.5700378417969,
        687.08642578125,
        553.9454345703125,
        699.0416259765625
      ],
      "point": [
        391.5700378417969,
        696.4149780273438
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "의 얽힘, 예를 들면 폰 노이만"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l8:s0-16",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        8,
        0,
        16
      ],
      "source": "entropy) is the same as in the singlet state.",
      "rect": [
        72.91903686523438,
        700.0354614257812,
        294.6999816894531,
        711.9906616210938
      ],
      "point": [
        72.91903686523438,
        709.364013671875
      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "엔트로피는 단일항 상태의 얽힘과 같다고 말한다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p12:b16:l9:s0-24",
      "page": 12,
      "at": [
        16,
        9,
        0,
        24
      ],
      "source": "Who is right? What is the mistake of the one who is wrong?",
